{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Woods is a witch-themed Open World Survival Craft sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* IMPORTANT *</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONLY compatible with 16:9 resolutions (available in settings)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONLY mouse &amp; keyboard is supported (no steamdeck / controller support)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fairly complex, non-handholding game with many hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will probably die, but it gets easier once you are familiar with the items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.poster.avif?t=1758174941\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.webm?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/67166d3745eb564eda02f9e53cec5bb9.mp4?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam around on your fancy traveller wagon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom outfits for your witch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools to gather magical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage your health, happiness, hunger and thirst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt a companion cat or unicorn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your secluded witch cabin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.poster.avif?t=1758174941\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.webm?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/9fc6c2261e5efe7f0c7c67d611023164.mp4?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill mode available for a more relaxed gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions and trade with merchants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautiful locations on an enchanted broom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing wildlife encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural generation for a unique experience  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.poster.avif?t=1758174941\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.webm?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/extras/02c08f335a65528434019b42c748f57a.mp4?t=1758174941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2729830?t=1758174941","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758174941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729830/c891dd444668fb292112cfa815c87d10e10bada9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758174941","capsu